    Activation requires explicit Linux-exclusive ownership and MII/RMII
    board wiring. No hardware link, DMA lifecycle or IRQ contract is proved.
+
+config NT98513_USB_HOST_BOARD
+ bool "Experimental NT98513 board with disabled USB host candidate"
+ depends on NT98513_ETHERNET_BOARD && USB_FOTG210_NT98513
+ default n
+ help
+   Add a disabled inherited-state USB host node alongside disabled Ethernet.
+   Control/bulk only. A failed halt after DMA publication panics before any
+   DMA-buffer reclamation. No physical USB or Wi-Fi acceptance is implied.
