+ help
+   Builtin permanent NT-specific host using the FOTG transfer engine.
+   Requires externally qualified stock host initialization, stable clocks,
+   PHY/VBUS state and exclusive Linux ownership. Control/bulk only.
+   After DMA publication a failed bounded halt panics to prevent unsafe
+   DMA-buffer reclamation. The supplied board node remains disabled.
